      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: I wonder if replacing `2` with `BMP_SIGNATURE_SIZE` would make it a tiny bit clearer that `BMP_SIGNATURE` and `BITMAPARRAY_SIGNATURE` refer to the same 2 bytes.\n\n```suggestion\npub const BMP_SIGNATURE: [u8; BMP_SIGNATURE_SIZE] \u003d [0x42, 0x4D];\npub const BMP_SIGNATURE_U16: u16 \u003d 0x4D42;\npub const BITMAPARRAY_SIGNATURE: [u8; BMP_SIGNATURE_SIZE] \u003d [0x42, 0x41];\npub const BMP_SIGNATURE_SIZE: usize \u003d 2;\n```",
      "range": {
